# Hip relationships reasoning draft

This batch adds three original, revision 1, draft anatomy questions. Existing `limb-*` reasoning concepts already cover piriformis, obturator internus, both gemelli, and quadratus femoris; this batch does not revise them. The implementation is `lib/hip-relationships-reasoning.ts`; its exact identity record is `content/hip-relationships-reasoning-pins.json`, generated against parent source `39dbb747a44feb0f4bc83e757310c5e3d1b49580`. The six records below bind to one BodyParts3D/isa source file per side. All have region `thigh` and muscle tissue by default. Ordered source regions are `[thigh, pelvis]` except tensor fasciae latae, which has `[thigh]`.

